        "body": "## Summary\n\n- Adds `specs/profile-discovery-surfaces.md` for ClawHub profile, feed, search, and discovery surfaces around account and publisher feeds.\n- Defines display rules for claimed, verified, official, OpenClaw reviewed/scanned, followed, and locally approved labels without collapsing them into one trust badge.\n- Covers profile content, discovery filters, empty/restricted states, feed page behavior, accessibility, and open product questions.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD -- specs/profile-discovery-surfaces.md specs/README.md`\n- `rg -n \"Microsoft|micorosf|tenant|MOS3|M365|enterprise\" specs/profile-discovery-surfaces.md` returned no matches\n- `bun run format:check -- specs/profile-discovery-surfaces.md specs/README.md` was not run: `bun` is not installed in this Windows shell\n\n## Proof Output\n\n```text\n> git diff --check origin/main...HEAD -- specs/profile-discovery-surfaces.md specs/README.md\n<no output>\n\n> rg -n \"Microsoft|micorosf|tenant|MOS3|M365|enterprise\" specs/profile-discovery-surfaces.md\n<no matches; exit 1>\n\n> Get-Command bun -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\n<no output; bun is not installed in this Windows shell>\n```",
